      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This clause generally allows you to use the generalized knowledge or underlying concepts you gain, often referred to as \"residuals.\" It specifically protects you from being stopped because you learned a pattern or logic while reviewing their confidential data. However, you are strictly prohibited from disclosing the actual specific confidential information you learned, so you cannot share any proprietary secrets gathered. This usually means you are safe to apply general skills to other work.",
